{
  "jobBrief": "Chief Financial Officer — Series C fintech scale-up (120 employees, $40M ARR). Reports to CEO. Must have led finance through a Series B or later raise, owns FP&A and investor relations, ideally has payments or lending sector experience, and has managed a team of 8+.",
  "candidateProfile": "Priya Menon — CFO at a fintech lending platform for 4 years, led the Series C raise ($55M) and built the FP&A function from scratch. Previously VP Finance at a payments company. Manages a team of 10 across finance and accounting. MBA, CPA. Based in Singapore, open to relocation."
}

{
  "text": "CFO with 8+ years in fintech, led two Series C raises, deep experience in payments and lending sector finance, built and scaled FP&A teams."
}
